--
-- conformance: pending
-- This chunk contains only native_integer_spills.luau checks that currently fail in
-- Waluau. Remove this directive when the whole chunk passes.
--
-- Split from conformance/luau/native_integer_spills.walu. Minimal setup is
-- repeated as needed so each numbered chunk is independently discoverable by
-- the conformance runner.

